 null, "summary": "Validate dimensions/cellsize/coverage/finite elevations/count/NoData -2147483648; first row north/first column west; actual header governs markers with \u22642-cell bbox tolerance; NoData unfilled.", "rationale": "Aligned output grids differ from request bbox and incorrect orientation would misplace location evidence.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_adr_021_batimetri_gmrt_backend_php_gd_bathymetry_map_and_provenance_archive", "label": "PHP GD bathymetry map and provenance archive", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/ADR-021-batimetri-gmrt-backend.md", "source_location": "line 12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "summary": "PNG raster/derived contours/legend/location/north/coordinates/distance/time/CC BY credit; archive original compressed grid plus hashes and actual header; AI only sees image/backend summary.", "rationale": "Deterministic map with audit evidence avoids extra GIS hosting dependencies or expanded prompts.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_adr_021_batimetri_gmrt_backend_secondary_bathymetry_interpretation_boundary", "label": "Secondary bathymetry interpretation boundary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/ADR-021-batimetri-gmrt-backend.md", "source_location": "line 13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "summary": "Summary describes whole-map extrema and output cell size, not source precision or tidal datum; positive elevations retained; contours interpolate cell centers and do not add measurements.", "rationale": "Secondary GMRT/GEBCO compilation cannot guarantee small nearshore site detail, sediment or navigation safety.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_adr_021_batimetri_gmrt_backend_gmrt_gridserver_documentation", "label": "GMRT GridServer documentation", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisions/ADR-021-batimetri-gmrt-backend.md", "sou